# Minimum and maximum distances and a point on a segment (F2): a line
# of 30 given a minimum of 40 grows to it, labelled "min 40.00"; a
# maximum of 50 leaves it as it is. A point off to the side put on the
# segment comes to its nearest place between the ends. On Segment with
# nothing selected says what to select.
key s
move 200 250
down L 200 250
up L 200 250
move 350 250
down L 350 250
up L 350 250
key esc
move 275 250
down L 275 250
up L 275 250
menu Constrain|Minimum Dimension
edit 40
dump
move 275 250
down L 275 250
up L 275 250
menu Constrain|Maximum Dimension
edit 50
dump
key p
move 260 330
down L 260 330
up L 260 330
key esc
move 260 330
down L 260 330
up L 260 330
move 300 250
down L 300 250
up L 300 250
menu Constrain|On Segment
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Constrain|On Segment
